# The look every recording shares. Each tape Sources this file right after its
# Output lines, so a font or size change is one edit, not one per tape.
#
# main-hd.tape alone keeps its own settings, at twice the size (font 22 here is
# 11). The pacing rule (the hold tiers and the Wait rules) is in AGENTS.md,
# "Feature documentation".

Set WindowBar Colorful

Set Margin 15
Set MarginFill "#674EFF"
Set BorderRadius 10

Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 11
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800

Set TypingSpeed 120ms
